x10x17cm.', '', 'Directions: \r\nPour diffuser oil into glass / ceramic container.  Place all reeds into a container to absorb the oil.  Then, flip such reeds and place a dry side of reeds into a container.  Let the diffuser spread your space.  \r\n\r\nIn the set:\r\n\r\nJanvier Diffuser Oil100 ml.\r\n\r\nEn Toute Saison Vase with stopper\r\n\r\n6 pcs reed Sticks', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 'admin', '2021-08-13 09:23:22', '1.46.23.209'),
