(1, 'BATH & BLOOM', 'BATH & BLOOM', 'Bath & Bloom was originated in 2002 with an aim to create a happiness in a bathroom. Our product is an easy tool to fulfill your happiness from a refreshing, lively and relaxing your mind from all work job each day.\r\n\r\nWe aim to produce a good quality product and all the scent is made from natural ingredients. Let Bath & Bloom create a unique scent for your unique lifestyle.\r\n\r\nWe have a strong commitment to use recycle packaging, natural product ingredients, best quality product and no animal testing.We are also against child labor and will never do.', 'Bath & Bloom was originated in 2002 with an aim to create a happiness in a bathroom. Our product is an easy tool to fulfill your happiness from a refreshing, lively and relaxing your mind from all work job each day.\r\n\r\nWe aim to produce a good quality product and all the scent is made from natural ingredients. Let Bath & Bloom create a unique scent for your unique lifestyle.\r\n\r\nWe have a strong commitment to use recycle packaging, natural product ingredients, best quality product and no animal testing.We are also against child labor and will never do.', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/Mp29biOOp4M', 'admin', '2020-08-27 15:08:13', '180.183.116.145');
